          "description": "Static registry of all 268 packet types. Maps packet ID to PacketInfo (id, name, channel, type, fixedBlockSize, maxSize, compressed, validate, deserialize). Provides lookup by ID or class. Inner record PacketInfo and enum PacketDirection (ToServer, ToClient, Both).",
          "file": "PacketRegistry.java"
        },
