      "InteractionType (used as map key in ProjectileConfig.interactions)",
      "InteractionTarget (used in RemoveEntityInteraction)",
      "InteractionCooldown (used in RootInteraction, RootInteractionSettings, ResetCooldownInteraction, TriggerCooldownInteraction)",
